#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/client-libraries/Working-with-Client-Libraries/Creating-A-Workspace/Creating-A-Workspace.rst:19
msgid ""
"ROS workspaces let you develop and test packages without changing your main "
"ROS installation. This tutorial describes how to create, build, source, and "
"modify an overlay workspace. After following these steps, you will be able "
"to use overlays for iterative package development."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/client-libraries/Working-with-Client-Libraries/Creating-A-Workspace/Creating-A-Workspace.rst:27
msgid ""
"**Goal:** Create a workspace and learn how to set up an overlay for "
"development and testing."
msgstr ""

